  nodeTextLayers:
  - title: 
    basic: A SNARE complex consists of several membrane bound proteins that vesicle
      membrane fusion depends on.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: SNARE complex is activated by calcium ions, also the product of the GLP1-R
      signaling cascade.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: Calcium triggers plasma membrane-bound and vesicle-bound SNARE components
      to interact and intertwine.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: The two phospholipid bilayers are pulled together, merging and forming
      a hole to allow material exchange.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
